Nishinomiya Kofun, sekkan-2.jpg|House-shaped stone coffin body
Nishinomiya Kofun, genshitsu-1-2.jpg|burial chamber (back wall direction)
Nishinomiya Kofun, genshitsu-2-2.jpg|burial chamber (entrance direction)
Nishinomiya Kofun, sendou-2-2.jpg|Passage (entrance direction)
Nishinomiya Kofun, sendou-1-2.jpg|Passage (burial chamber direction)
</gallery>

