'''Nishinomiya Kofun''' (西宮古墳/にしのみやこふん) is a {{ill|kofun|ja|古墳|1=Kofun|qq=draft}} located in {{ill|Heguri|ja|平群町|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Ikoma District, Nara|lt=Ikoma District|ja|生駒郡|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Nara Prefecture|ja|奈良県|qq=draft}}. It has a {{ill|square Kofun|ja|方墳|1=Square Kofun|1=Square Kofun|qq=draft}} structure and has been Historic Site1 as a historical site by Nara Prefecture.

